{"id":"n67022-1-8","stage":5,"title":"뒤처지다 · 落后","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67022-1-8-1","ko":"하루도 빠짐없이 신문과 뉴스를 보신다면서요?","zh":"您不是说每天都会坚持看报纸和新闻吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하루도","meaning":"某天，一日，有一天","explanation":"하루：某天，一日，有一天；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49315","senseId":"3","lemma":"하루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빠짐없이","meaning":"一个不落地","explanation":"빠짐없이：一个不落地","readings":[{"term":"빠짐없이","audio":"/audio/81137d80c1472c19503c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60833","senseId":"1","lemma":"빠짐없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신문과","meaning":"报纸","explanation":"신문：报纸；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"신문","audio":"/audio/bcf27ef578d25dc71d55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65337","senseId":"1","lemma":"신문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뉴스를","meaning":"新闻，新事件","explanation":"뉴스：新闻，新事件；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"뉴스","audio":"/audio/5ac661dbed5720aed8f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32795","senseId":"2","lemma":"뉴스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보신다면서요?","meaning":"阅读，看","explanation":"보다：阅读，看；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ다면서요：引用所听到的动作陈述，再向对方确认。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"3","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"621a158068fae5de","term":"하루","zh":"某天，一日，有一天","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3","entryId":"49315","definition":"不特定的某个日子。","pronunciation":["하루"]},{"id":"81137d80c1472c19","term":"빠짐없이","zh":"一个不落地","audio":"/audio/81137d80c1472c19503c.mp3","entryId":"60833","definition":"没有漏掉任何一个，全部地。","pronunciation":["빠ː지멉씨"]},{"id":"bcf27ef578d25dc7","term":"신문","zh":"报纸","audio":"/audio/bcf27ef578d25dc71d55.mp3","entryId":"65337","definition":"告知世上新发生的事件的定期刊物。","pronunciation":["신문"]},{"id":"5ac661dbed5720ae","term":"뉴스","zh":"新闻，新事件","audio":"/audio/5ac661dbed5720aed8f4.mp3","entryId":"32795","definition":"初次被公开的新消息。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"阅读，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"读书籍、报纸、地图中的字、图、符号等而理解内容。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/27c4b14dc261d42d2c50.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67022-1-8-2","ko":"예. 시대의 흐름에 뒤처지지 않으려는 노력이지요.","zh":"是的。这是为了不落后于时代的发展啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"예.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"예：是，行","readings":[{"term":"예","audio":"/audio/2eb73fba696e2fe4ea0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73966","senseId":"2","lemma":"예","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시대의","meaning":"时代，当代","explanation":"시대：时代，当代；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"시대","audio":"/audio/0ba34ab95fbb912ac3c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65119","senseId":"2","lemma":"시대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"흐름에","meaning":"潮流，长河，进程，流程","explanation":"흐름：潮流，长河，进程，流程；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"흐름","audio":"/audio/b6b379e35f9ccc79e6df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87885","senseId":"2","lemma":"흐름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒤처지지","meaning":"落后","explanation":"뒤처지다：落后；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"뒤처지다","audio":"/audio/2e25b5e36763016c14c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67022","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒤처지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않으려는","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；으려는：表示正打算或意图做某事，修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노력이지요.","meaning":"努力，下工夫","explanation":"노력：努力，下工夫；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"노력","audio":"/audio/1119b060db74766fb336.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62400","senseId":"1","lemma":"노력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2eb73fba696e2fe4","term":"예","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/2eb73fba696e2fe4ea0a.mp3","entryId":"73966","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["예ː"]},{"id":"0ba34ab95fbb912a","term":"시대","zh":"时代，当代","audio":"/audio/0ba34ab95fbb912ac3c7.mp3","entryId":"65119","definition":"现在的时代；或指问题所在的该时期。","pronunciation":["시대"]},{"id":"b6b379e35f9ccc79","term":"흐름","zh":"潮流，长河，进程，流程","audio":"/audio/b6b379e35f9ccc79e6df.mp3","entryId":"87885","definition":"(喻义)按一定方向进行的现象。","pronunciation":["흐름"]},{"id":"2e25b5e36763016c","term":"뒤처지다","zh":"落后","audio":"/audio/2e25b5e36763016c14c4.mp3","entryId":"67022","definition":"能力或水平未能达到一定的基准，跟不上。","pronunciation":["뒤ː처지다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"1119b060db74766f","term":"노력","zh":"努力，下工夫","audio":"/audio/1119b060db74766fb336.mp3","entryId":"62400","definition":"为达到某种目的而尽心尽力。","pronunciation":["노력"]}],"audio":"/audio/8326d702e223c0eeac49.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.264,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67022","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":151,"sequenceScore":2.9893,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的。这是为了不落后于时代的发展啊。","听到‘敏俊’这个名字的时候，你脑子里会不会立刻浮现什么印象？","您不是说每天都会坚持看报纸和新闻吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是的。这是为了不落后于时代的发展啊。","您不是说每天都会坚持看报纸和新闻吗？","听到‘敏俊’这个名字的时候，你脑子里会不会立刻浮现什么印象？"],"answer":0}]}
